    <h1>Happy Girlfriend's Day [Rohini]!</h1>
    <img src="1757818176951.jpg" alt="GF Picture">
    <p>Tumhari har ada mein basi hai meri duniya, tumhari aankhon mein chupta hai mera jahaan.

Tumse hi shuru hoti hai meri life ki kahani, aur tum par hi end ho meri khushiyan saari. Is ruhani safar mein hum aise kho gaye hain ki khud se hi bekhabar hain, bas tum hi tum ho mere dil ki har dhadkan mein yahan.</p>

